OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AJay-Z rape accuser says her allegation
OL,4,Awas false
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement filed in that case on
OL,7,FThursday, she wrote: "Shawn 'Jay-Z'
OL,8,FCarter never raped me. I have never met
OL,9,For spoken to Mr. Carter. Mr. Carter
OL,10,Fnever engaged in any inappropriate
OL,11,Fconduct toward me whatsoever."
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
